#* {{zh-x|往 者 不可 諫，來 者 猶 可 追。|As to the past, reproof is useless; but the future may '''still''' be provided against.|ref=Analects}}
#* {{zh-x|四海 無 閒 田，農夫 猶 餓死。|Not a field in the land is dormant, yet farmers '''still''' starve to death.|CL-L|ref='''Tang Dynasty''', {{lw|zh|李紳}} [<nowiki/>{{w|Li Shen}}<nowiki/>], {{lang|zh|憫農}} [Pitying the Farmer]}}
